# Browser-safe URL only. Never place database/MySQL credentials in frontend VITE_* variables.
# Example: http://localhost:8080/api or http://localhost:5000
# Leave empty to use local in-memory mock data.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Backend CORS & Security Notes:
# - Ensure your backend enables CORS for frontend dev server: http://localhost:3000 (or custom Vite port)
# - Allowed headers: Content-Type, Authorization
# - Allowed methods: GET, POST, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS
# - Frontend transmits auth token via 'Authorization: Bearer <token>' header
